elvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">全球AI集体大罢工：海外多款主力大模型突发瘫痪超3小时，国内大模型淡定在线</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI证实自研人形机器人并布局数据中心特种机器人</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Google DeepMind 发布 WeatherNext 3：实现 5 公里分辨率与小时级刷新</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌9月4日起停用安卓端Google Assistant，全面切换至Gemini</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/3d4c56ca5191ff6c5b5ae4b6a63a0c6f.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌于9月4日起正式在安卓手机端停用Google Assistant，并将符合条件的用户逐步迁移至Gemini。此次迁移过程预计持续数周，除手机外，智能手表、耳机及Android Auto也将同步转向Gemini。对于不满足Gemini配置要求的旧设备或未开放服务的地区，Google Assistant将暂时保留，但大多数用户将在未来一至两个月内失去访问权限。搭载Android系统的电视、机顶盒及内置Google服务的汽车暂不受影响，后续将通过系统升级完成迁移。此次调整标志着谷歌将“嘿，谷歌”语音入口从传统助手升级为生成式AI交互，旨在以Gemini重构Android生态。尽管Gemini在复杂任务上能力更强，但在计时器、音乐播放等高频指令的响应稳定性和准确性上仍面临用户反馈与挑战。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">英伟达宣布以129亿美元收购开源AI平台Hugging Face</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/8ba88b9d91febbbc7bd322b257d80990.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">英伟达（NVIDIA）正式宣布以129.303亿美元收购开源AI平台Hugging Face。Hugging Face目前拥有超1800万开发者，托管超300万个模型、50万个数据集及100万个应用，是全球开源模型核心枢纽。英伟达此前已在平台发布500多个模型及250多个数据集。CEO黄仁勋承诺，收购后Hugging Face将保持平台独立与开放属性，继续支持各类开源及开放权重模型，并坚持多云与多加速器发展路线。英伟达明确表示不会将平台改造为封闭入口，旨在利用自身基础设施与工程能力，推动开放权重技术在工厂、医院、教育等场景的落地，通过规模化优势反哺开源生态，降低企业与科研机构使用先进AI能力的门槛。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">全球AI集体大罢工：海外多款主力大模型突发瘫痪超3小时，国内大模型淡定在线</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/6c291c0e954e49b085d2530517daa36f.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">全球AI集体大罢工：海外多款主力大模型突发瘫痪超3小时，国内大模型淡定在线AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · Sep 4, 202639月3日美东时间上午9点23分左右，全球人工智能领域遭遇了一场罕见的行业大地震。包括ChatGPT、Claude、Grok、谷歌Gemini以及微软Copilot在内的多款海外头部AI服务集体出现故障，大面积陷入瘫痪状态。此次突发的大规模宕机持续了大约3小时40分钟，给大批海外用户的日常办公与技术调用带来了短暂的困扰。与海外大模型的集体掉线形成鲜明对比的是，国内人工智能大模型在同一时间段内保持了平稳高效的正常运行。其中，国内AI代表企业智谱更是通过社交平台公开幽默发文表态称“我们还在线”，展现出了坚实的底层技术韧性与基础设施承载能力。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI证实自研人形机器人并布局数据中心特种机器人</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b86d0f100045a3facaa2d35ab82d7c28.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI首席执行官山姆·奥尔特曼近日证实，公司正同步推进人形机器人与面向数据中心场景的特种机器人研发。奥尔特曼强调，机器人形态并非核心，关键在于“机器人大脑”，即以GPT-6 Astra为代表的智能模型。OpenAI Robotics事业部目前正重点扩招硬件执行器相关岗位，涵盖执行器设计、电磁与齿轮设计及测试基础设施，旨在实现机器人硬件与机器学习的深度协同。在落地节奏上，OpenAI明确家用机器人并非当前首要任务，基础设施与制造业场景才是研发重心，但公司长期看好消费级市场潜力。目前，OpenAI尚未公布具体发货日期与产量目标。此前，OpenAI曾通过接入Figure AI的Figure 01机器人进行技术验证，此次自研布局标志着其在机器人硬件领域从软件算法向底层执行器设计的全栈式拓展。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Google DeepMind 发布 WeatherNext 3：实现 5 公里分辨率与小时级刷新</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/ffbe77738741cca256b1fa6bd79cba81.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Google DeepMind 与 Google Research 联合发布 WeatherNext 3 天气模型，通过直接接入实时全球静止卫星拼图与原始气象站数据，解决了传统 AI 模型分辨率低及初始化依赖滞后等痛点。该模型采用函数生成网络（FGN）网格 Transformer 架构，支持多分辨率输出，最高分辨率达 0.05°（约 5 公里）。在刷新频率上，模型实现每小时初始化一次，其中 00、06、12、18 UTC 可预报至 15 天。针对降水预测，其在短时效内的 CRPS 指标较基线最高提升 60%。此外，模型新增 100 米风速、云层分布及太阳辐照等关键变量，直接服务于可再生能源电网调度。目前，Brightband 独立评测将其列为迄今最准确的全球天气模型。用户可通过 BigQuery、Earth E</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
